  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0060_rival_01",
      "hash": "f88daec11e528db7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：等下！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0060_rival_04",
      "hash": "f88da9c11e528538",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n仅仅只停留在捕捉宝可梦上，\\r\\n是绝对不够的！\\c\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]训练家[VAR COLOR(0000)]之间还可以\\n用宝可梦展开[VAR COLOR(0006)]对战[VAR COLOR(0000)]！\\c\\n宝可梦对战是什么感觉？\\n我现在就来告诉你！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0060_rival_05",
      "hash": "f88daac11e5286eb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "开始对战吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0060_8rom_01",
      "hash": "326ab01253605bf3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 3]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0060_rival_02",
      "hash": "f88dafc11e528f6a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：哎……\\n白说了一番高高在上的话，\\r\\n简直太丢人了！\\c\\n早知道就先好好训练之后\\n再来和你对战了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0060_rival_06",
      "hash": "f88dabc11e52889e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：哦耶～！\\c\\n……啊！\\n你也别太难过了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0060_rival_03",
      "hash": "f88db0c11e52911d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "今后也时常跟我比试比试吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0060_doctor_01",
      "hash": "82095c54a6abe594",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n第一次对战，感受如何？\\c\\n你的搭档[VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\n也非常努力了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0060_doctor_02",
      "hash": "82095f54a6abeaad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：你可以\\n通过和更多的训练家对战，\\r\\n来培养你的宝可梦唷！\\c\\n在这个过程中也试着\\n不断捕捉新的宝可梦吧！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0060_max",
